{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "70a48faa-c91a-872e-9cbe-a030841a7250",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T15:38:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yeah, I'm calling about the plow. They came through this morning and left a berm right across our driveway. A wall of it, plowed snow and ice, packed solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no fun. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "429 Kay Street. Up on the Hill. It's a shared driveway, so it's blocking me and the neighbors both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 429 Kay. And this was from the plow that went by today, not something left over from before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today. We barely got a dusting last night, honestly, it's not even a real storm. But it's freezing out, like single digits with the wind, so what they pushed over is turning to concrete. By tonight I won't get a shovel into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it sets up fast in this cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. And I'm not shoveling a wall like that every time they go by. I just want it logged so there's a record that it happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can absolutely log that. Let me put it in. Shared driveway at 429 Kay Street, berm across the entrance after plowing this morning. Anything about access I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. [pause] What, Gram? No, I'm on with the city. Sorry, my grandmother lives with us, she's calling from the other room. She wants to know if I'm yelling at them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tell her you're being very civil."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm being civil. Barely. Anyway, we can't get a car out, and she has appointments, so it matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I've noted it as blocking vehicle access. I'll send it over to the crew supervisor, but I can't tell you exactly when someone will get out there, since they're still working the routes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Just make sure it's in there. My number's 401-555-0182 if they need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182. It's logged, Ms.?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gallagher. Maureen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Maureen. Stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
